  <p>This new public page is a static proof-and-calculation notebook, not a public GPU endpoint or a repair of the private LaTeX app. Its math rendering and deterministic examples need no GPU. The failed model calculation is why numerical checks—not model confidence—provide the evidence here. <a href={`${assets}/runtime-verification.json`}>Read the sanitized runtime receipt.</a></p>
